graph LR
    subgraph Host["Analyst Trusted Workstation"]
        A[Security Analyst] --> B[ETAS Dashboard & API]
        B --> C[Static Threat Assessment]
        C --> D{Suspicious / High-Risk Case?}
    end

    subgraph Transfer["Controlled Air-Gap Boundary"]
        D -- Authorized Manual Handoff --> E[Controlled Transfer Gateway]
        E -- One-Way Staging --> F[Isolated Virtual Disk]
    end

    subgraph Sandbox["Isolated Dynamic Analysis Environment (Disposable VM)"]
        F --> G[Guest OS: Windows / Linux Sandbox]
        G --> H[Process & Registry Monitoring: Procmon / Sysmon]
        G --> I[Network Simulation: FakeNet-NG / INetSim]
        G --> J[Memory & Behavioral Inspection]
    end

    subgraph Recovery["Containment & Restoration Controls"]
        G -. Revert to Pristine Snapshot .-> K[Snapshot / Clean State Restoration]
        J -- Sanitized Behavioral Artifacts --> L[IoC & Evidence Persistence]
    end

    L --> B
